@startuml
title Deployment Diagram - Local (docker-compose)
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

node "Developer Machine" as Dev {
  artifact "Browser\nlocalhost:8080" as Br
}

node "Docker Host (docker compose)" as Host {
  node "Container: app\n(build ./code/Dockerfile)" as AppC {
    artifact "Spring Boot app.jar\n:8080" as J
  }
  node "Container: database\n(postgres:16-alpine)" as DbC {
    database "PostgreSQL\ndb: auction" as P
  }
  storage "Volume: postgres_data" as Vol
}

Br --> J : HTTP :8080 (APP_PORT)
J --> P : JDBC :5432\njdbc:postgresql://database:5432/auction
P -- Vol

note bottom of AppC
  Dockerfile multi-stage:
  eclipse-temurin:26-jdk build (Maven Wrapper)
  -> eclipse-temurin:26-jre run
  app depends_on database (service_healthy)
end note
@enduml
